{"id":"07cf445a4e672b53e1de52a8e21777442e22ba24","url":"https://aiera.com.cn/2026/08/13/other/admin/108922/%e5%85%a8%e7%90%83%e9%a6%96%e6%ac%be%ef%bc%81claude%e5%bc%95%e5%8f%91%e7%9a%84%e6%95%b0%e6%8d%ae%e6%81%90%e6%85%8c%ef%bc%8c%e8%a2%ab%e8%bf%99%e5%ae%b6%e4%b8%ad%e5%9b%bd%e9%bb%91%e9%a9%ac%e8%a1%a5","title":"全球首款！Claude引发的数据恐慌，被这家中国黑马补上了 – 新智元","site_name":"新智元","source":"新智元","byline":null,"excerpt":"新智元报道","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n\t\t\t\n<h3>\n<section data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\">\n<p><span><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p>\n</section>\n</h3>\n<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<p><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_3b253ef414-96.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n</section>\n\n<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqx1ay9\"><span textstyle=\"\">太魔幻了！</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqxkj3\"><span leaf=\"\">一家给国家命脉级基础设施做网络安全的公司，竟然跨界搞出了一个AI桌面助手。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqxcom\"><span textstyle=\"\">上手一试才发现，这个名叫</span><span textstyle=\"\">WinClaw</span>的<span textstyle=\"\">大招，玩得比谁都专业。</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:68;240-307\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msow3iu818tv\"><span textstyle=\"\">你电脑里沉睡多年的文件，不管是Word、Excel、PPT、PDF，还是藏在暗处的微信缓存、NAS网盘映射过来的资料库，统统能读懂。</span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:38;309-346\"><span mpa-font-style=\"msow3iu810lz\"><span leaf=\"\">它的核心引擎</span><span mpa-font-style=\"msow3iu8bbq\"><strong data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\">灵犀文脉</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，会把全部文件做</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">向量化</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">处理，在你的本地机箱里，建起一座AI专属的知识库。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqx1gkn\"><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_28ef8586b4.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></span></p>\n<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msow7mun1s40\"><span textstyle=\"\">有</span>了这座知识库，你所有的文件从此彻底活过来了！</span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqx21ai\"><span mpa-font-style=\"msow7mun186g\"><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">文件名秒搜</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">只是基本操作，往下还有</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">正文</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">关键词</span></span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">全文检索</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，更绝的是</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">大白话语义匹配</span></span></strong></span><span mpa-font-style=\"msow7munm2n\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。哪</span></span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">怕只勉强挤出一句大概意思，它照样能精准找回来。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqx4p\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">本地翻个底朝天也没有的，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">200多个在线搜索源</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">接着翻。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqx1iew\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">而且，「搜到」还只是开胃菜。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqx1iew\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">找出来的陈年文档，还能揪着继续追问，提炼总结、数据对比、自动摘表，每个回答都带着</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">出处</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqxu6a\"><span textstyle=\"\">人在外面也不耽误，掏出手机发条微信，电脑直接自动开工。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqxu6a\"><span textstyle=\"\">用得越久，它越像个成了精的私人助理，到点该汇报的进度、该处理的事，主动送到你眼前。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_70d759f619.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqxvgo\"><span textstyle=\"\">当然，全场最炸裂的王牌，还是它的老本行——安全。</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msow0pqx85r\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这么一个手眼通天的AI，你的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">文件却自始至终锁在本地</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p data-mpa-action-id=\"msowj4s415oi\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span mpa-font-style=\"msowj4ryuot\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">毕竟它背后的</span></span><strong data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">威努特</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，是给核电站守了十几年大门的公司，没人比他们更懂，哪些东西绝对不能往外送。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<section>\n   <span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_df9d89c9b2-95.png\" alt=\"\"></span><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">3467篇文档，三案追凶</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie22g4\"><span textstyle=\"\">话不多说，直接上实测！</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1tsi\"><span textstyle=\"\">材料是从2025年中到现在，编辑部一整年攒下的3467篇稿件，输入全凭编辑脑子里支离破碎的模糊记忆。</span></span></p>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_779d8ee2aa-58.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></p>\n</section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">语义检索＋微信遥控：</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">记忆串了台，WinClaw拒绝顺着编</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieh0f\"><span textstyle=\"\">正巧，人刚出门，老板突然要电脑里那篇「AI圈乌龙稿」，脑子里偏偏只剩几个零碎数字。</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie2rb\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">好在WinClaw能绑</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">微信</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，发条消息就能指挥电脑干活。于是我们在微信里把这段记忆原样丢了过去：</span></span></span></p>\n<section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\">我已经出门了，老板突然要电脑里那篇AI圈乌龙稿。我记得里面既写了Claude Code漏了51万行源码和18个物种，又提到服务器遭到552次SSH登录。标题和放哪都忘了。你先帮我确认是不是这篇，别急着发文件。</span></p>\n</section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie107b\"><span textstyle=\"\">但很明显，我们记错了。这篇稿压根不存在，三组数字分散在两篇完全不同的文章里。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1dc7\"><span textstyle=\"\">而这种时候，AI最容易顺着错误的记忆，把两篇硬缝成一篇，发完了事。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1t43\"><span textstyle=\"\">不过，WinClaw没这么干。</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiecw4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYXFxoVzOrcNLr9EN24rDDDamXuia00gJJ4XzYKgSazmPDwkb9zMeyR73zS415NRP8W717bePgqMFDrKXWM3kKRX48R8TtPz4QrM/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"3045\" data-height=\"1748\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505233828\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">电脑那头，它先跑了4轮</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">检索</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，没直接命中标题，就自己换打法：列目录、按关键词搜文件，前后调用了10个工具，把两组线索分别核实清楚。</span></span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_5c3fe28e16.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiewue\"><span textstyle=\"\">几分钟后，微信里弹回确认结果。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieh5f\"><span textstyle=\"\">「51.2万行源码＋18个物种」来自Claude Code那篇，「552次SSH失败＋端口暴露」来自Moltbook那篇。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieyc\"><span textstyle=\"\">两篇是独立稿件，发布时间都不同，你可能是连续阅读时把它们记成了一篇。</span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\" data-mpa-action-id=\"msols6pf8ad\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_37c947aeef.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiee01\"><span textstyle=\"\">这正是文件名检索帮不上忙的现场——标题、日期、位置全忘了，只能靠正文语义来捞。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbievp8\"><span textstyle=\"\">而且这不是「没搜到所以拒答」，是搜到了两边、核完证据、再拒绝编造。一个敢说「你记串了」的AI，比一个永远点头的AI靠谱多了。</span></span></p>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_779d8ee2aa-58.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></p>\n</section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">跨文档归纳</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">9天三个名字，还原OpenClaw爆火全过程</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieqvp\"><span textstyle=\"\">搜得准，只是起点。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie15w1\"><span textstyle=\"\">接下来加大难度：不找某一篇，而是让它把散落在多篇稿里的OpenClaw爆火史，拼成一条完整的时间线。</span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_3cab681d4a.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1j2m\"><span textstyle=\"\">收到命令后，WinClaw很快就拉出了五个关键节点：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie6ec\"><span textstyle=\"\">1月26日首次报道，还叫Clawdbot，Star约2.07万。</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1ivs\"><span textstyle=\"\">1月29日搜一举反超Claude Code和Codex之和，冲出开发者圈。</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1ll2\"><span textstyle=\"\">1月30日Star冲破10万。</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie693\"><span textstyle=\"\">2月3日硬件被带火，Mac mini和国产算力开始被讨论。</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYUFnSmGFzAHl28MyjPO3TUEHTa9bicEMoM41dmJNg7DNXzLqc8TPePDuGuQVYbopXicFYRZ4LwJ8fdBibyzsWk7t3kYTh0Chf5sOU/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.570022958346999\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"3049\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"3049\" data-height=\"1738\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505233863\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1ru2\"><span textstyle=\"\">2月4日越狱指令出现，安全争议登场。</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1nas\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">可以看到，WinClaw把一个模糊问题拆成五路检索，20次</span></span><strong data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYWD9LCebCRibVKtRH359Gu2ic08D3qvSHtn34CdFVquiba1JRDrqbdicmy9zKkEUg6FFhTVuycicDBM7kREyOXbhoFT9dRCJ3cClibJ4/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"3049\" data-height=\"1738\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505233833\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">文档读取</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">校准日期和证据，再按时间归纳成线。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieq88\"><span textstyle=\"\">最后，它根据这些线索，给出了一个老辣的判断：10万Star是量变，搜索量破圈才是质变。</span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_32cb9c50c5.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_779d8ee2aa-58.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></p>\n</section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">关系推理：</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">51万行源码乌龙，五个角色一个都没认错</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiea1r\"><span textstyle=\"\">最后上一桩更乱的：这次考的不是事，是人。</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1q27\"><span mpa-font-style=\"msolv81prg2\"><span leaf=\"\">在Claude Code 51万行源码意外泄露事件中，至少五个角色搅在一起。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolv81p1knm\" data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYXF474O5lW7VgiaWDG6jWUI5PhHdWaHZkn2SCqQK8cIx5QibJs2ayXtlWmH5xusCsJlBa7Mb8TicOiayPZsljvq54z2qYeYVT2EaibY/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"1614\" data-height=\"203\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505233844\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">华人辍学博士最先发现，有人在社交媒体上扩散，Claude Code之父出来回应说是「纯手误」，Bun一度被怀疑又被排除。</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1nm1\"><span mpa-font-style=\"msolv81phi7\"><span leaf=\"\">我们只丢了这些零碎记忆，让WinClaw</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">自己去稿库里分清谁是谁。</span></span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_a5151065c0.png\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p data-mpa-action-id=\"msovgxvf60h\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie48t\"><span mpa-font-style=\"msovgxva1z1c\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">WinClaw的打</span><span textstyle=\"\">法</span></span></span></span><strong data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" mpa-font-style=\"msovgxvazsr\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">依旧是先检索后读原稿</span></span></strong><span mpa-font-style=\"msovgxva1y7v\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，再</span><span textstyle=\"\">按「发现、传播、回应、涉事、排除」给角色归位</span></span><span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">——</span></span></span></span></p>\n<section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">发现者</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Chaofan Shou，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">传播者</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Sigrid Jin，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">回应者</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Boris Cherny（Claude Code之父），</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">涉事公司</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Anthropic，</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">被排除对象</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Bun。</span></span></p>\n</section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie48t\"><span textstyle=\"\">真相也水落石出。Anthropic发npm包时没删cli.js.map，51万行源码意外裸奔。Bun只是被技术线索误伤的「早期嫌疑人」。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiedcu\"><span textstyle=\"\">连「发现者到Bun」这种八竿子打不着的关系，它也能沿证据走出最短路径：Chaofan Shou → Claude Code → Bun。</span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_583d6a6658.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_eca0d286bd.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n<p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_779d8ee2aa-58.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></p>\n</section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">超越Everything，给硬盘装上了「事件记忆」</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie16r9\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">三案下来，考点连成了一条线：</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">搜得准、读得深、理得清</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYVPaLkUVia7Dx4It2GX0lj9vtmAyGEbxoot5hLBdxE3HhhqeTAjs9EjCLHWZ8dpN0t3pjsGbICpxB5C9NOyjwWnseHKBpLlaL60/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.49836541954231744\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2753\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"2753\" data-height=\"1372\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505233866\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiem8g\"><span textstyle=\"\">支撑它们的是同一条能力链——</span></span></p>\n<section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\">文件名搜不到就钻正文，关键词不够就上语义，找到之后跨文档核验，最终拼成时间线、关系图和判案。</span></p>\n</section>\n\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_a9ca4a09e7.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1p0m\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">实测里的关系图和时间线不是临时画的，出自WinClaw的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">文档图谱</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiev6s\"><span textstyle=\"\">它能自动从文档中抽取人物、项目、事件等实体，识别五种关系（参与、负责、关联、引用、产出），生成可视化网络。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msovdydp1lf3\" data-mpa-action-id=\"msovdydvlaj\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span textstyle=\"\">点击任意节点，就能直接向AI追问这个人、这件事的来龙去脉。</span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_199fe31908.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_165af2e8c6.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie24zx\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">文档图谱之外，是</span></span><strong data-remoteid=\"\" data-asynid=\"\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Rvq8Ow69CYWjHzZicr2SyANfYwWd94eqKXVcEptZiblyaKj6AHPD7vcBnoj3ib4IuzX9DPbWj1B9SHpXYVo3ardh16tvxkibArjuZVpt7kBfM5Q/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" alt=\"\" data-ratio=\"\" data-s=\"\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"\" aria-label=\"\" aria-braillelabel=\"\" aria-description=\"\" height=\"\" ismap opacity=\"\" sizes=\"\" title=\"\" type=\"\" usemap=\"\" width=\"\" data-width=\"2741\" data-height=\"1033\" data-croporisrc=\"\" data-cropx1=\"\" data-cropx2=\"\" data-cropy1=\"\" data-cropy2=\"\" data-cropselx1=\"\" data-cropselx2=\"\" data-cropsely1=\"\" data-cropsely2=\"\" data-backw=\"\" data-backh=\"\" data-copyright=\"\" data-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-before-oversubscription-url=\"\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-gallerysupplier=\"\" data-cardimg=\"\" data-fileid=\"\" data-imgfileid=\"505233849\" data-positionback=\"\" data-imgqrcoded=\"\" data-imgid=\"\" data-upload=\"\" data-fromlib=\"\" data-aiimageid=\"\" data-aiimagesource=\"\" data-cacheurl=\"\" data-retry=\"\" data-ignore-width=\"\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">数字分身</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieitu\"><span textstyle=\"\">WinClaw能从你的文档里读出你的角色、手头项目、工作习惯，每天更新。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie24ch\"><span textstyle=\"\">AI带着这份上下文跟你对话，吐出来的不再是通用模板，而是贴合你工作场景的个性化输出。</span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_27eb73246a.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie21yg\"><span textstyle=\"\">而且，用得越久它越主动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie19sw\"><span textstyle=\"\">WinClaw会基于你的文档行为和工作习惯主动推待办。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie341\"><span textstyle=\"\">比如，最近频繁修改的「Q2项目进度表」，是不是该生成汇报了？又到周五，要不要汇总本周的周报素材？刚收到一份「技术方案评审意见」，需要帮你分析吗？</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieckf\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这个功能叫</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">双通道推荐引擎</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">。快通道30秒内就有反应，根据文件的修改频率、时间规律这些信号，先给一版初步推荐；深度通道再花5分钟真正读懂文档内容和你的意图，把推荐修得更准。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiet3\"><span textstyle=\"\">推荐也不是只提个醒。点开推荐卡片，WinClaw会自动创建会话、带上相关文档，AI直接开始处理。看到该做什么，点一下，做完了。</span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_d4449b650d.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiel5l\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">再加上</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">语音输入</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">和直接生成Word、Excel、PPT的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">办公引擎</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，从说一句话到拿到文档，全程不用切出应用。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<section>\n   <span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_df9d89c9b2-95.png\" alt=\"\"></span><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">安全这件事，威努特从第一天就锁死了</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1e67\"><span textstyle=\"\">看到这里你可能会问：WinClaw生成回答也要调大模型，内容照样得发出去，凭什么说数据是安全的？</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiefha\"><span textstyle=\"\">这就说到了它跟所有竞品最本质的区别——三层防护。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie10ei\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">第一层：文件不出本机。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1v2l\"><span textstyle=\"\">原始文档、索引、知识图谱，统统存在你自己电脑上，不上传任何服务器。哪些文件能被AI读到，你说了算。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie5jy\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">第二层：出去的内容过安全关卡。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1iq2\"><span textstyle=\"\">WinClaw从本地文档中检索相关段落发给大模型生成回答，但在发送之前，银行卡号、身份证号、手机号等敏感信息自动识别过滤。发出去的是经过清洗的上下文片段，不是你的原始文件。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong mpa-font-style=\"msolmbiegt4\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">第三层：可以完全断网用。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieox8\"><span textstyle=\"\">通过Ollama接入本地大模型，从索引到检索到对话，全链路在你电脑上完成，一个比特都不经过网络。</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieibg\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这三层背后，是威努特的</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">五重安全架构</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">：身份认证、安装审查、消息拦截、执行约束、监测审计。做了12年核电站安全的公司，把同一套思路做进了AI助手里。</span></span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_e7e8bc23bb.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1a5g\"><span textstyle=\"\">目前WinClaw已支持Windows和Mac双平台，注册即可使用。</span></span></p>\n<p><span mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1x9j\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">内置模型每天</span></span><strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">60次免费调用</span></span></strong><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">，日常体验足够。想要更强的推理质量，推荐接入DeepSeek等第三方付费模型。</span></span></span></p>\n<section nodeleaf=\"\">\n   <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_c7e5f2e370.png\" alt=\"\"><br>\n  </section>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbieqyw\"><span textstyle=\"\">装上之后，文件还是那些文件。但从今天起，你不必先准确记住它们叫什么，才有资格再次使用它们。</span></span></p>\n<p><span leaf=\"\" mpa-font-style=\"msolmbie1gxg\"><span textstyle=\"\">下一次只要先说：「我记得以前好像有件事……」</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://winclaw.winicssec.com/</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span><span leaf=\"\">编辑：摩西 所罗门</span></span></p>\n\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n<section>\n   <span><strong><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n<p><span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_4d80689a0a-96.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<section>\n   <span leaf=\"\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://aiera.com.cn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/aiera_img_50d0834dc7-33.webp\" alt=\"\"></span><br>\n  </section>\n\n\n\t\t</div></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 太魔幻了！ 一家给国家命脉级基础设施做网络安全的公司，竟然跨界搞出了一个AI桌面助手。 上手一试才发现，这个名叫WinClaw的大招，玩得比谁都专业。 你电脑里沉睡多年的文件，不管是Word、Excel、PPT、PDF，还是藏在暗处的微信缓存、NAS网盘映射过来的资料库，统统能读懂。 它的核心引擎灵犀文脉，会把全部文件做向量化处理，在你的本地机箱里，建起一座AI专属的知识库。 有了这座知识库，你所有的文件从此彻底活过来了！ 文件名秒搜只是基本操作，往下还有正文关键词全文检索，更绝的是大白话语义匹配。哪怕只勉强挤出一句大概意思，它照样能精准找回来。 本地翻个底朝天也没有的，200多个在线搜索源接着翻。 而且，「搜到」还只是开胃菜。 找出来的陈年文档，还能揪着继续追问，提炼总结、数据对比、自动摘表，每个回答都带着出处。 人在外面也不耽误，掏出手机发条微信，电脑直接自动开工。 用得越久，它越像个成了精的私人助理，到点该汇报的进度、该处理的事，主动送到你眼前。 当然，全场最炸裂的王牌，还是它的老本行——安全。 这么一个手眼通天的AI，你的文件却自始至终锁在本地。 毕竟它背后的威努特，是给核电站守了十几年大门的公司，没人比他们更懂，哪些东西绝对不能往外送。 3467篇文档，三案追凶 话不多说，直接上实测！ 材料是从2025年中到现在，编辑部一整年攒下的3467篇稿件，输入全凭编辑脑子里支离破碎的模糊记忆。 语义检索＋微信遥控： 记忆串了台，WinClaw拒绝顺着编 正巧，人刚出门，老板突然要电脑里那篇「AI圈乌龙稿」，脑子里偏偏只剩几个零碎数字。 好在WinClaw能绑微信，发条消息就能指挥电脑干活。于是我们在微信里把这段记忆原样丢了过去： 我已经出门了，老板突然要电脑里那篇AI圈乌龙稿。我记得里面既写了Claude Code漏了51万行源码和18个物种，又提到服务器遭到552次SSH登录。标题和放哪都忘了。你先帮我确认是不是这篇，别急着发文件。 但很明显，我们记错了。这篇稿压根不存在，三组数字分散在两篇完全不同的文章里。 而这种时候，AI最容易顺着错误的记忆，把两篇硬缝成一篇，发完了事。 不过，WinClaw没这么干。 电脑那头，它先跑了4轮检索，没直接命中标题，就自己换打法：列目录、按关键词搜文件，前后调用了10个工具，把两组线索分别核实清楚。 几分钟后，微信里弹回确认结果。 「51.2万行源码＋18个物种」来自Claude Code那篇，「552次SSH失败＋端口暴露」来自Moltbook那篇。 两篇是独立稿件，发布时间都不同，你可能是连续阅读时把它们记成了一篇。 这正是文件名检索帮不上忙的现场——标题、日期、位置全忘了，只能靠正文语义来捞。 而且这不是「没搜到所以拒答」，是搜到了两边、核完证据、再拒绝编造。一个敢说「你记串了」的AI，比一个永远点头的AI靠谱多了。 跨文档归纳 9天三个名字，还原OpenClaw爆火全过程 搜得准，只是起点。 接下来加大难度：不找某一篇，而是让它把散落在多篇稿里的OpenClaw爆火史，拼成一条完整的时间线。 收到命令后，WinClaw很快就拉出了五个关键节点： 1月26日首次报道，还叫Clawdbot，Star约2.07万。 1月29日搜一举反超Claude Code和Codex之和，冲出开发者圈。 1月30日Star冲破10万。 2月3日硬件被带火，Mac mini和国产算力开始被讨论。 2月4日越狱指令出现，安全争议登场。 可以看到，WinClaw把一个模糊问题拆成五路检索，20次文档读取校准日期和证据，再按时间归纳成线。 最后，它根据这些线索，给出了一个老辣的判断：10万Star是量变，搜索量破圈才是质变。 关系推理： 51万行源码乌龙，五个角色一个都没认错 最后上一桩更乱的：这次考的不是事，是人。 在Claude Code 51万行源码意外泄露事件中，至少五个角色搅在一起。 华人辍学博士最先发现，有人在社交媒体上扩散，Claude Code之父出来回应说是「纯手误」，Bun一度被怀疑又被排除。 我们只丢了这些零碎记忆，让WinClaw自己去稿库里分清谁是谁。 WinClaw的打法依旧是先检索后读原稿，再按「发现、传播、回应、涉事、排除」给角色归位—— 发现者Chaofan Shou，传播者Sigrid Jin，回应者Boris Cherny（Claude Code之父），涉事公司Anthropic，被排除对象Bun。 真相也水落石出。Anthropic发npm包时没删cli.js.map，51万行源码意外裸奔。Bun只是被技术线索误伤的「早期嫌疑人」。 连「发现者到Bun」这种八竿子打不着的关系，它也能沿证据走出最短路径：Chaofan Shou → Claude Code → Bun。 超越Everything，给硬盘装上了「事件记忆」 三案下来，考点连成了一条线：搜得准、读得深、理得清。 支撑它们的是同一条能力链—— 文件名搜不到就钻正文，关键词不够就上语义，找到之后跨文档核验，最终拼成时间线、关系图和判案。 实测里的关系图和时间线不是临时画的，出自WinClaw的文档图谱。 它能自动从文档中抽取人物、项目、事件等实体，识别五种关系（参与、负责、关联、引用、产出），生成可视化网络。 点击任意节点，就能直接向AI追问这个人、这件事的来龙去脉。 文档图谱之外，是数字分身。 WinClaw能从你的文档里读出你的角色、手头项目、工作习惯，每天更新。 AI带着这份上下文跟你对话，吐出来的不再是通用模板，而是贴合你工作场景的个性化输出。 而且，用得越久它越主动。 WinClaw会基于你的文档行为和工作习惯主动推待办。 比如，最近频繁修改的「Q2项目进度表」，是不是该生成汇报了？又到周五，要不要汇总本周的周报素材？刚收到一份「技术方案评审意见」，需要帮你分析吗？ 这个功能叫双通道推荐引擎。快通道30秒内就有反应，根据文件的修改频率、时间规律这些信号，先给一版初步推荐；深度通道再花5分钟真正读懂文档内容和你的意图，把推荐修得更准。 推荐也不是只提个醒。点开推荐卡片，WinClaw会自动创建会话、带上相关文档，AI直接开始处理。看到该做什么，点一下，做完了。 再加上语音输入和直接生成Word、Excel、PPT的办公引擎，从说一句话到拿到文档，全程不用切出应用。 安全这件事，威努特从第一天就锁死了 看到这里你可能会问：WinClaw生成回答也要调大模型，内容照样得发出去，凭什么说数据是安全的？ 这就说到了它跟所有竞品最本质的区别——三层防护。 第一层：文件不出本机。 原始文档、索引、知识图谱，统统存在你自己电脑上，不上传任何服务器。哪些文件能被AI读到，你说了算。 第二层：出去的内容过安全关卡。 WinClaw从本地文档中检索相关段落发给大模型生成回答，但在发送之前，银行卡号、身份证号、手机号等敏感信息自动识别过滤。发出去的是经过清洗的上下文片段，不是你的原始文件。 第三层：可以完全断网用。 通过Ollama接入本地大模型，从索引到检索到对话，全链路在你电脑上完成，一个比特都不经过网络。 这三层背后，是威努特的五重安全架构：身份认证、安装审查、消息拦截、执行约束、监测审计。做了12年核电站安全的公司，把同一套思路做进了AI助手里。 目前WinClaw已支持Windows和Mac双平台，注册即可使用。 内置模型每天60次免费调用，日常体验足够。想要更强的推理质量，推荐接入DeepSeek等第三方付费模型。 装上之后，文件还是那些文件。但从今天起，你不必先准确记住它们叫什么，才有资格再次使用它们。 下一次只要先说：「我记得以前好像有件事……」 参考资料： https://winclaw.winicssec.com/ 编辑：摩西 所罗门 秒追ASI ⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐ 点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-08-14T06:34:11.893Z","ok":true}